  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-05-14T16:36:20.351Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd like to be able to turn my head at a wider angle before the torso follows. Its quite obnoxious to look up and the whole chest turns upward too. This seems to be an avatar setting in VRchat, please turn down the sensitivity so that the body doesn't follow as if stiff-necked. I dont want to spend money on additional software or equipment just so that my head turns better. Also, the head turns at the neck angle instead of the head, please fix that too as it makes head turning look awkward and stiff.",
